<h3>2. Common Pronunciation Challenges</h3>
<p>Not all pronunciation gaps cause equal confusion. Intelligibility research on Thai-accented English consistently points to <strong>unreleased final consonants</strong> as the single biggest source of misunderstanding — which is why releasing your final /t/, /k/, and /p/ pays off fastest.</p>

