  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;"><strong>Minimization</strong></td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;">"It's just old equipment," "Everyone has issues," "You're too sensitive"</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #ddd; padding:8px;">Doubt in own perception of severity; suppression of legitimate complaints</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
