<!-- SECTION 3: RECLAIMING PERCEPTUAL TRUST -->
<h2>3. Documenting Inversion: From Self-Doubt to Evidence</h2>
<p>Inversion thrives on isolation and ephemerality. Systematic documentation restores epistemic agency.</p>

