  <li><strong>Input:</strong> Button pressed, verbal request made, form submitted.</li>
  <li><strong>Output:</strong> Actual response received (video/audio if possible).</li>
  <li><strong>Discrepancy:</strong> Clear statement of mismatch ("Asked for X, received Y").</li>
  <li><strong>Witnesses:</strong> Names/contact who observed the inversion.</li>
  <li><strong>Aftermath:</strong> How the system/person explained it (or didn't).</li>
